     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<br><br>Based on a quick search on this topic (shiny google group, general google search, Shiny website article and reference pages), I found a few old posts on passing text data using renderText or using global objects created in global.R (<a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?hl=en#!searchin/shiny-discuss/pass$20data/shiny-discuss/4XUDMMp87v8/Nm5W08wSb6EJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?hl%3Den%23!searchin/shiny-discuss/pass$20data/shiny-discuss/4XUDMMp87v8/Nm5W08wSb6EJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792393759529000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2CVO2YpaI3IpPTQzyvze3W\">https://groups.google.com/forum/?hl=en#!searchin/shiny-discuss/pass$20data/shiny-discuss/4XUDMMp87v8/Nm5W08wSb6EJ</a>) but I am wondering: are global variables still the recommended way to pass complex R objects between server and ui, or is there a more direct way?<br><br>Thanks<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shinydashboard</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>a </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;some text&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>b </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">a</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>l </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">a</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">a</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">b</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">b</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  l$test </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE<br>  <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dashboardPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  header</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dashboardHeader</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  sidebar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dashboardSidebar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  body</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dashboardBody</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    conditionalPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      condition </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;l.test&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        verbatimTextOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  title</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Mess around&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  skin</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;blue&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><br><br></div>"
